          "title": "Balancing Combustion of Propane",
          "problemStatement": "Balance the chemical reaction: $C_3H_8 + O_2 \\\\rightarrow CO_2 + H_2O$.",
          "stepByStepSolution": [
            "Step 1: Balance Carbon: $3$ carbons on left $\\\\implies 3 CO_2$.",
            "Step 2: Balance Hydrogen: $8$ hydrogens on left $\\\\implies 4 H_2O$.",
            "Step 3: Balance Oxygen: Right side has $3(2) + 4(1) = 10$ oxygens $\\\\implies 5 O_2$. Balanced: $C_3H_8 + 5O_2 \\\\rightarrow 3CO_2 + 4H_2O$."
